Native MC@NLO-Delta stopping scales
=================================

mcatnlo_delta_scales.f90 reconstructs stopping scales, dipole masses and
dead-zone flags from real momenta and the selected FKS Born colour flow.
It needs no shower library, initialization, PDFs or random numbers.
MG5 supplies the starting scales and retains the scale vetoes, Sudakov
tables, PDF factors and H-event scale assignment. Creating new Sudakov
tables and showering the generated events independently use Pythia.

Provenance and license
----------------------

The module was supplied in /export/tmp/rikkert/git/mcatnlo_delta_scale.
It translates the default QCD formulas in Pythia 8.313 History::pTLund
and Merging::clusterAndStore/getDipoles (Stefan Prestel, Pythia authors).
It is distributed under GPL-2.0-or-later; the license text accompanies
this file as mcatnlo_delta_scales.COPYING. The supplied module's SHA-256
